  "notes": [
    "MINI running recordings are a 2019 Cooper S engine/chassis contact recording; body/exhaust and mic perspective differ from the Cabrio. Startup is a Fiat Punto Grande petrol I4 substitute.",
    "Z4 M40i B58 is represented by a BMW M4 S55 turbo inline-six recording, NOT an exact Z4 recording. Neutral-load recordings are shaped by load at runtime; these are not independently recorded on/off load banks.",
    "Octavia taxi is represented by VW Passat diesel startup/idle, Audi 1.9 TDI 2000 RPM and VW Caravelle 2.0 TDI 3000 RPM. These are related diesel substitutes, NOT an exact Octavia recording.",
    "RPM references are estimates from harmonic analysis except the producer-labelled 2000/3000 RPM loops. Loops are trimmed, mono mixed, high-pass filtered, pitch-stabilized where specified, overlapped at their seams and level matched.",
    "Sonniss recordings are licensed for use inside this game; they are not CC0 and must not be redistributed as a standalone sound pack. License version 2.0 effective 2026-08-27 applies."
